  "hypothesis": {
    "id": "ONE-LOW-SUPPORT-BASE-JUMP",
    "status": "UNVERIFIED_PROPOSAL_NOT_IMPLEMENTED",
    "claim": "For the first naturally committed phase1 roll in this exact existing App/seed, use the already authored adjacent low platform as a real grounded launch point, instead of running off its footprint and jumping from floor into the tall upper bell. Then one normal grounded jump when the incoming real rig enters the support horizontal span may allow a damage-free pass-under/side-crossing.",
    "why_causal": [
      "Every observed floor-jump roll lost one HP near upper-bell height; four later side crossings were damaged, not evasions.",
      "First committed roll warning starts while player x6358.665 is within actual low platform footprint; current pilot instead runs toward Boss until beyond its right edge.",
      "The low platform is130 above floor and already physically supports this same base player later in trace; no extra jump charge is required if ordinary floor->platform landing genuinely occurs.",
      "Act only after actual group selection so the initial roll cannot be obtained by changing RNG or forcing its state."
    ],
    "steps": [
      "Read existing installed plains_bellstrider_arena module Definition and its actual world transform; select its existing lower support under/adjacent to player. Do not copy geometry or build collision proxies.",
      "On the first naturally observed phase1 roll_warning, use ordinary axis toward that support center and original held jump input; require a real grounded landing on that support. No reset_at, snap, clock write, health/resource reset or artificial used_jumps reset.",
      "While supported, keep the actor over the platform instead of original approach sprint. When the incoming current body_contact_rect leading horizontal edge reaches the support span, issue one ordinary grounded held jump and keep horizontal intent over the support. This uses existing threat geometry for input choice only; damage remains native body_contact_sweep/policy. No sweep over thresholds/timings.",
      "Require actual airborne Boss side crossing and landing with unchanged HP for the whole committed group. Reuse original recovery firing and its two-shot maximum, no extra defensive shot. Resume the existing observer and preserve all later failures; do not call a first-group success a completed fight."
    ],
    "failure_conditions": [
      "No eligible actual support or cannot physically land on it before attack: hypothesis fails rather than teleport/fallback grant.",
      "Any accepted player damage, no actual airborne pass-under/crossing, no landing, or altered normal HP/energy/ability/ammo state: fail.",
      "No naturally selected eligible roll within unchanged battle budget: missing proof, not pass.",
      "Original later full-fight failure remains failed. Phase2 return-roll/other maps/corners and repeating this route are unverified until separately observed."
    ],
    "success_scope": "At most one actual phase1 support-assisted basic-jump roll counterplay demonstration, with real pre-landing and no added ability. It does not prove unchanged floor-only old68-frame promise or complete full185/formal fairness.",
